<title>BELGIUM: CAMPINE FALLS TO 58 MLN LOSS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>CAMPINE FALLS TO 58 MLN LOSS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(In millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net loss		     58   vs	  48 profit</p>
<p>    Cons current loss		  18   vs	  54 profit</p>
<p>    Cons turnover		   1,924   vs     1,856</p>
<p>    Non-cons net profit		 5   vs	  61</p>
<p>    Non-cons current profit	  27   vs	  74</p>
<p>    Non-cons investments	    101   vs	  74</p>
<p>    Non-cons exceptional charges   23   vs	 n/a</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)	   100   vs	 190</p>
<p>NOTE - Campine NV is a Belgian lead and antimony producer. It also recycles waste containing lead.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
